{"logId": "a415d080-604e-4754-a16e-31b439b9817c", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [848, 135, 1082, 251], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[848.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 251.0], [848.0, 251.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "您买回家还是要用热毛巾擦一遍吧，不仅仅是为了擦上面的胶，您睡觉之前擦一遍，躺上去会更加凉快，白天也要擦一擦上面的汗。”大姐笑着说是说：“我不擦，我怕浪费水。”哎，真拿她没办法，送走大姐，我心里暗暗好笑，天下竟然有这么吝啬的人，心里不舒服呀。", "block_bbox": [197, 228, 976, 360], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 228.0], [976.0, 228.0], [976.0, 360.0], [197.0, 360.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "过了两天区长突然对我说：“你上次接待的顾客，让我多表扬表扬你呢！说她不是故意刁难你，是想看看你适不适合这份工作，看看你是不是合格的服务员，没想到你没有急，让她很满意，而且还教育了她儿子。”我听了不知该高兴还是难过，只是很纳闷，这和教育她儿子有什么关系？又过了几天再次见到这位大姐，她一见到我就说：“小姑娘，不好意思呀，上次不是故意难为你了，我是为了教育我儿子，上次来那个小孩是我儿子，他不好好学习，没有耐心，我专门让他来和我一起买东西，就是让他看看你们的敬业精神，这种百拿不厌的态度……”", "block_bbox": [197, 367, 976, 604], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 367.0], [976.0, 367.0], [976.0, 604.0], [197.0, 604.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "从这件事中我明白了一个道理，只要真心对待每一个人，用真诚的服务感动每一个人，用真情换真心，最终一定会赢得顾客的认可和尊敬，以后我会热爱我的岗位，一如既往地做好我的服务工作，让顾客满意，开心，放心！", "block_bbox": [197, 611, 978, 709], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 611.0], [978.0, 611.0], [978.0, 709.0], [197.0, 709.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "谢谢您，善良的老人", "block_bbox": [201, 767, 676, 823], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 767.0], [676.0, 767.0], [676.0, 823.0], [201.0, 823.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：超市部/王媛媛", "block_bbox": [516, 832, 677, 854], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[516.0, 832.0], [676.0, 832.0], [676.0, 853.0], [516.0, 853.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "正忙着收钱的时候，听见一位阿姨叫我一声，手里掂了一兜东西。她神秘地说：“孩子，你先给别人收吧，待会儿我给你说个事！”等不忙时，我说：“姨，怎么了？”", "block_bbox": [198, 871, 975, 933], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 871.0], [975.0, 871.0], [975.0, 933.0], [198.0, 933.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "她四下看了看，凑到我身边小声说：“孩子，你多找了我五毛钱，我都跑回家了，一看兜里多了五毛钱，就赶紧给你送来了，可不能让你自己赔了，站一天挺不容易的。”原来，她在我们店买了一兜的菜和日用品，她给我零钱时，我发现她手里还有几枚硬币。我就说：“阿姨，我给你换成整的吧，拿着方便。”仅仅这一句话，就让这位阿姨又大老远送来，还悄悄对我说：“孩子，我都不敢吭声，等没人才给你讲，怕你挨吵。”我这时才意识她为什么要等到收银台没人时，为什么要四下看看，为什么要凑到我身边并且很小声，原来都是在为我考虑。将心比心，虽然只有五角钱，但想想平时老人们买菜，为了一角二角，都要精打细算，真不容易。", "block_bbox": [197, 941, 977, 1212], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 941.0], [977.0, 941.0], [977.0, 1212.0], [197.0, 1212.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "爱，是互动的，当我们付出了真爱的时候，顾客也会给我们更多的爱。", "block_bbox": [238, 1219, 832, 1246], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1219.0], [832.0, 1219.0], [832.0, 1246.0], [238.0, 1246.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "销售幸福", "block_bbox": [111, 1407, 261, 1449], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [261.0, 1407.0], [261.0, 1449.0], [111.0, 1449.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1000, 609, 1137, 724], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[1000.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 724.0], [1000.0, 724.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7359620928764343, "coordinate": [848, 135, 1082, 251], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[848.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 251.0], [848.0, 251.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9191052317619324, "coordinate": [197, 228, 976, 360], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 228.0], [976.0, 228.0], [976.0, 360.0], [197.0, 360.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9533516764640808, "coordinate": [197, 367, 976, 604], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 367.0], [976.0, 367.0], [976.0, 604.0], [197.0, 604.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9312962293624878, "coordinate": [197, 611, 978, 709], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 611.0], [978.0, 611.0], [978.0, 709.0], [197.0, 709.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.86772221326828, "coordinate": [201, 767, 676, 823], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[201.0, 767.0], [676.0, 767.0], [676.0, 823.0], [201.0, 823.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7714455127716064, "coordinate": [516, 832, 677, 854], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[516.0, 832.0], [676.0, 832.0], [676.0, 853.0], [516.0, 853.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9138661026954651, "coordinate": [198, 871, 975, 933], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 871.0], [975.0, 871.0], [975.0, 933.0], [198.0, 933.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9622985124588013, "coordinate": [197, 941, 977, 1212], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 941.0], [977.0, 941.0], [977.0, 1212.0], [197.0, 1212.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8274515867233276, "coordinate": [238, 1219, 832, 1246], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 1219.0], [832.0, 1219.0], [832.0, 1246.0], [238.0, 1246.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8357122540473938, "coordinate": [111, 1407, 261, 1449], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [261.0, 1407.0], [261.0, 1449.0], [111.0, 1449.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.41937369108200073, "coordinate": [1000, 609, 1137, 724], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1000.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 609.0], [1137.0, 724.0], [1000.0, 724.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "您买回家还是要用热毛巾擦一遍吧，不仅仅是为了擦上面的胶，您睡觉之前擦一遍，躺上去会更加凉快，白天也要擦一擦上面的汗。”大姐笑着说是说：“我不擦，我怕浪费水。”哎，真拿她没办法，送走大姐，我心里暗暗好笑，天下竟然有这么吝啬的人，心里不舒服呀。\n\n过了两天区长突然对我说：“你上次接待的顾客，让我多表扬表扬你呢！说她不是故意刁难你，是想看看你适不适合这份工作，看看你是不是合格的服务员，没想到你没有急，让她很满意，而且还教育了她儿子。”我听了不知该高兴还是难过，只是很纳闷，这和教育她儿子有什么关系？又过了几天再次见到这位大姐，她一见到我就说：“小姑娘，不好意思呀，上次不是故意难为你了，我是为了教育我儿子，上次来那个小孩是我儿子，他不好好学习，没有耐心，我专门让他来和我一起买东西，就是让他看看你们的敬业精神，这种百拿不厌的态度……”\n\n从这件事中我明白了一个道理，只要真心对待每一个人，用真诚的服务感动每一个人，用真情换真心，最终一定会赢得顾客的认可和尊敬，以后我会热爱我的岗位，一如既往地做好我的服务工作，让顾客满意，开心，放心！\n\n## 谢谢您，善良的老人\n\n作者：超市部/王媛媛\n\n正忙着收钱的时候，听见一位阿姨叫我一声，手里掂了一兜东西。她神秘地说：“孩子，你先给别人收吧，待会儿我给你说个事！”等不忙时，我说：“姨，怎么了？”\n\n她四下看了看，凑到我身边小声说：“孩子，你多找了我五毛钱，我都跑回家了，一看兜里多了五毛钱，就赶紧给你送来了，可不能让你自己赔了，站一天挺不容易的。”原来，她在我们店买了一兜的菜和日用品，她给我零钱时，我发现她手里还有几枚硬币。我就说：“阿姨，我给你换成整的吧，拿着方便。”仅仅这一句话，就让这位阿姨又大老远送来，还悄悄对我说：“孩子，我都不敢吭声，等没人才给你讲，怕你挨吵。”我这时才意识她为什么要等到收银台没人时，为什么要四下看看，为什么要凑到我身边并且很小声，原来都是在为我考虑。将心比心，虽然只有五角钱，但想想平时老人们买菜，为了一角二角，都要精打细算，真不容易。\n\n爱，是互动的，当我们付出了真爱的时候，顾客也会给我们更多的爱。\n\n## 销售幸福\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_609_1137_724.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_848_135_1082_251.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a415d080-604e-4754-a16e-31b439b9817c/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_848_135_1082_251.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A28%3A05Z%2F-1%2F%2F961bb184775e072fef820b49f5dfea5fe8c298ee2c28cc9a577b568f3eb47193", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_609_1137_724.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a415d080-604e-4754-a16e-31b439b9817c/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_609_1137_724.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A28%3A05Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa65f3485a1ab3069298bd82be438e57e6ea76aa57baab3313d3b6e21224aeb4c"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a415d080-604e-4754-a16e-31b439b9817c/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A28%3A05Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc9e6e84781280c9e2d33a039af31885520e480f0e78a18af1f360f134a3586bb"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a415d080-604e-4754-a16e-31b439b9817c/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A28%3A06Z%2F-1%2F%2F3975302310044bad560269d1e1074e04d01711863413623e8e9a334403f25144"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//a415d080-604e-4754-a16e-31b439b9817c/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A28%3A06Z%2F-1%2F%2F68069a44df1361a9bc8cbf7d883ad32d418b20c09876f33540d06dcfc76e862a"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
